        "<strong>Dictionary (Easton's).</strong> <strong>BEDAN</strong> one of the judges of Israel (1 Samuel 12:11). It is uncertain who he was. Some suppose that Barak is meant, others Samson, but most probably this is a contracted form of Abdon (Judges 12:13).",
